Thelma Goldstone tested this puzzle for us. Besides being a wife and mother, Thelma keeps busy with hospital volunteer work and a number of hobbies. Of her interest in crossword puzzling she writes, "It started slowly and built up to what you would call a fever pitch." Thelma enjoyed this puzzle and finished it in one hour. "The question that gave me the clue to cracking the puzzle was 16 Down, 'Druggist Actor,'" she grants.

